gate: closeout.verify
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document
budget: 2
taxonomy: Completion Signals, Functional Scope & Behavior
produces: none
next: closeout.merge

gate: closeout.merge
skip_when: no scoped document's claims diverge from the branch result
budget: 1 question per document awaiting an update
taxonomy: Terminology & Consistency, Misc / Placeholders
produces: none
next: closeout.accept

gate: closeout.accept
skip_when: no scoped document carries status: draft
budget: 1 question per draft document in scope
taxonomy: Completion Signals
produces: none
next: closeout.capture

gate: closeout.capture
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document
budget: 1
taxonomy: Completion Signals, Constraints & Tradeoffs
produces: spec, doc, guide, or scenario through skills/_shared/tracks/describe.md; adr and its standard cascade through skills/_shared/tracks/decision.md; cpat, task-type, or guide per skills/_shared/tracks/experience.md; each per the Write routing of skills/_shared/durable-context-selection.md draft
next: closeout.discharge

gate: closeout.discharge
skip_when: the branch scope matches no plan document; or a task or acceptance criterion of that plan carries a verdict other than fulfilled. The gate names the unmet condition in the report and exits
budget: 1
taxonomy: Completion Signals
produces: none
next: end

